@startsalt
' Screen: Prompt Picker Modal
' User Stories:
'   - As a developer, I can search and select a prompt when configuring a script node
'   - As a developer, I can filter prompts by tag to narrow results
'   - As a developer, I can preview the prompt body before selecting it
'   - As a developer, I can see the published version and date before committing

{
  ' Modal overlay
  {+
    <b>Select a Prompt</b>                                                        [X]
    ==
    {
      "Search prompts...                    " | Tags: ^All Tags^
    }
    ..
    {
      ' Left: prompt list | Right: preview panel
      {
        {#
          <b>Name</b>              | <b>Version</b> | <b>Published</b>
          <color:blue><u>Code Review Bot</u></color>  | v4       | 2026-05-10
          SQL Query Helper     | v2       | 2026-05-08
          Summarize Diff       | v7       | 2026-04-29
          Test Case Writer     | —        | <i>draft</i>
          Explain Error        | v1       | 2026-04-10
          PR Description Gen   | v3       | 2026-04-05
        }
        ..
        <i>Showing 6 of 23</i>
      } | {
        ' Preview panel (right side)
        <b>Preview: Code Review Bot</b>  <color:green>v4 — Published 2026-05-10</color>
        ==
        {+
          "You are a senior {{language}} engineer               "
          "performing a code review.                            "
          "                                                     "
          "Reviewer persona: {{reviewer_persona}}               "
          "                                                     "
          "Review the following diff and provide:               "
          "1. A summary of changes                              "
          "2. Potential issues or bugs                          "
          "3. Style and readability suggestions                 "
          "4. Recommended action: Approve / Request Changes     "
          "                                                     "
          "Diff: {{diff_content}}                               "
          "                                                     "
          "Respond in {{output_language}} using                 "
          "{{output_format}} format.                            "
        }
        ..
        <b>Variables (5):</b> language*, reviewer_persona*, diff_content*, output_language, output_format
        ..
        <b>Used by:</b> 3 script nodes
      }
    }
    ==
    Pin to version: () Latest  (X) v4 (current)  () Specific version: "   "
    ..
    [Select Prompt]  [Cancel]
  }
}
@endsalt
